Eg&oe=6A5B60A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "6F81E256-DCEF-4DF5-8C57-988C9E030CF3.png", "id": "620909299718749", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982469_620909303052082_7936272622065240700_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eiW_bIkXnyEQ7kNvwG3Yg7J&_nc_oc=AdqCuwBQ7lA8KJGpLt1fvllrW-C9xKvwZ1WVxEuX3Te6wUfOXGYrskdSHh-S9rF17ic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDwDMVsZBuuOctY9ZdCtZ58sZbLLcm-aIwvtF89ahcO2A&oe=6A5B6A58"}, "display_name": "Animalz Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["animals", "augmentedreality", "mixedreality", "zoo", "handtracking"], "long_description": "Create an interactive Zoo in your home with over 60 animals! Come enjoy this animal VR experience!\n- pass through enabled to see animals in your actual surroundings in mixed reality\n- animals are placeable and moveable with random spawn options and deletion options, with various areas including custom visual boundaries and save state\n- variety of pre-made and customizable animal placements:\n-- full sized animals\n-- half sized animals\n-- tabletop sized animals\n- animals include: tigers, rhinos, hippos, lions, great white sharks, turtles, bears, zebras, deer, lizards, elephants, mountain goats, farm animals, dogs, cats, many birds, t-Rex and other dinosaurs, boars, leopards, and many more\n\nMajor February 2025 Update:\n- new bonus area full of animals and plants with no mixed reality\n- new animals: a whale, squid, dolphin, turtle, and 2 new dinosaurs\n- added various areas with the ability to use custom visual boundaries or to save the position of animals and plants that you move", "short_description": "Create an interactive Zoo in your home with over 60 animals! Try this animal VR experience!\n- pass through enabled to see animals in your actual surroundings in mixed reality\n- animals: placeable & moveable with random spawn options\n- variety of pre-made & customizable animal placements:\n-- 